	(text "Radio supply select (JP1-JP4, one per slot, fit ONE shunt):\n  1-2 = 5V   -> E01-2G4M27D only (VCC 2.5-5.5V, 390mA TX @5V)\n  2-3 = 3V3  -> nRF24L01+PA/LNA (VCC max 3.6V - 5V destroys it!)\nNo shunt = slot unpowered (safe default).\nU2 LD1117V33 (800mA) feeds all 3V3 slots from 5V_B: 4 x ~115mA nRF24 = ~0.8W in U2."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 63.5 85.09 0)
