	(text "Supply cross-feed: D2 (5V_A -> 5V_B) and D3 (5V_B -> 5V_A).\nTwo sources: each rail runs from its own input, the diodes stay off\n  while the inputs are within about 0.3 V of each other.\nOne source (either input): the other rail is fed through a diode,\n  about 0.35 V lower. Input A is preferred: the devkit then sees one drop, not two."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 248.92 205.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b7ace5a1-8a19-4039-b205-d685f73758a5")
	)
